WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.828
To upload an invoice, go to Orders, click Actions, then Upload invoice.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.219
Choose the invoice PDF.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:11.095
A SASH India invoice marks its orders Dispatched.

00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:14.543
A SASH Inc invoice marks them delivered to John Deere.

00:00:14.997 --> 00:00:18.805
Check the list of orders it goes to, then click Save invoice.
